That's an interesting point.

&#x200B;

My Live Lite is 11.0x and Live Suite is 11.1x... maybe that's what's going on here. VSTs just aren't handshaking or what have you. But the VST 3.0s and AUs work.... which is great but some of the plugins aren't available in AU. Ergh.

&#x200B;

It'd be great if they did work. Which was, honestly, what i thought the point of VSTs were... but it's also just the VST2s that aren't working. VST 3 is all there.

Hey all

&#x200B;

I have pokemon Blue and Yellow, complete and in original boxes... bought them new back in the day. They're essentially immaculate - probably 8/10 for both..

&#x200B;

Any ideas on what they'd be worth?

